    "text": "<p>Major product formed in the following reaction is a mixture of:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9c5d515a-15b7-444f-bc47-414d8e8b1f86.png\" style=\"width: 588px; height: 168px;\"/></p>",
